      "content": "TL 0902            ABBOTS LANGLEY          HIGH STREET                                            (Northwest side)                                            Abbots Langley 11/30                                      Henderson Memorial                                            about low NW of                                            Church of St. Lawrence GV                                         II Chest-tomb.  Mrs. Elvira Henderson,  d.1901.  Ashlar  with  ornamental copper. A long low rectangular tomb in an Art Nouveau Style. Copper moulded base with stylized trees rising at angles and along longer sides to projecting capping with bold raised lettering, foliate ornament to a smaller upper stone cap. Listing NGR: TL0945502195"
    }
